# Held keys play intervals over a sustained saw: G4 (+7), then E4 added (two-voice harmony +7 / +4), E4 alone after
# G4 lets go, C3 (-12), then back to P1 (detune).
tempo 120
steps 48
tail 0.5
track fx1
input saw 220 0.4
param p1 140
param p2 90
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
note 4 G4 16
note 12 E4 16
note 32 C3 8
expect sound 0 48
expect peak_below 0
